; stack.batt - Demonstrates stack operations: rot, nip, depth

; rot: rotate top 3 elements (a b c -- b c a)
"rot(1, 2, 3):" println
1 2 3 rot
; stack is now: 2 3 1
println println println

; nip: remove second element (a b -- b)
"nip(10, 20) = " print
10 20 nip
println

; depth: push current stack depth
"Empty stack depth = " print
depth println

1 2 3
"Stack depth with 3 items = " print
depth println
pop pop pop
